GoReNinja
=========

GoReNinja is a substantially expanded fork of GoLang binary parser.

Original project: https://github.com/dipusone/golang_pclntab_parser
Original author: Jacopo Ferrigno
Original license: MIT (see LICENSE)

The original copyright and license notices are preserved as required by the MIT
license. Subsequent modifications and new functionality are developed by the
GoReNinja contributors.

Upstream references used by the original project and this fork are listed in
README.md.
